onestly to get me into  gryffindor but yes i am in gryffindor  and that's it for this video what do you  guys think of these sortings do you find  it interesting that most of the actors  were sorted into the houses of  characters they played is that  coincidence if you want me to theorize  on the houses of some of the other  actors in another video then leave a  comment down below until next time  remember happiness can be found even in  the darkest of times if one only  remembers to turn on the light

